{
 "code": "RT",
 "name": "Daily top-3 rotation, liquid non-major perps (long only)",
 "tf": "1d",
 "version": 1,
 "round": 7,
 "hypothesis": "Among the most liquid non-major USDT-M perps, the coins with the strongest recent return keep outperforming the others over the next days (cross-sectional momentum), and holding cash when fewer than 3 have a positive return avoids the worst falls.",
 "rules": "Round 7 RT: daily rotation into the strongest coins of a liquid non-major universe, long only.\n\nAt each UTC day's close, score every candidate by its L-day log return, ln(C_D / C_{D-L}), C = the day's last\n1m close. A candidate is a member of the fill day's universe month that traded on day D, is outside a no-trade\ngap and its 7-day cooldown, has a fill row on day D+1, both closes, and no finished gap inside the lookback.\nEligible = score > 0 (absolute momentum). A held coin is kept while it is eligible and ranks <= H among the\ncandidates; free slots go to the best-ranked eligible coins (ties by symbol). K = 3 slots of 1/3 of the equity\neach; an empty slot is cash. Every held coin is resized to its 1/3 at each fill.\n",
 "params": {
